<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to UniRooms</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #2c3e50; background-color: #ecf0f1; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: #2c3e50; color: #ffffff; padding: 35px 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 3px solid #3498db; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .content { padding: 40px 35px; }
    .feature-box { background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 4px; padding: 25px; margin: 25px 0; border-left: 3px solid #3498db; }
    .feature-item { margin: 12px 0; padding-left: 25px; position: relative; color: #2c3e50; }
    .feature-item:before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #27ae60; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; padding: 14px 35px; background: #3498db; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 3px; margin: 25px 0; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
    .button:hover { background: #2980b9; }
    .footer { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 25px 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #7f8c8d; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Welcome to UniRooms</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      
      <p>Thank you for registering with UniRooms. Your account has been successfully created and verified. We are pleased to have you join our platform as a <strong>{{role}}</strong>.</p>
      
      <p>UniRooms is India's premier platform dedicated to connecting students with quality PG accommodations near colleges and universities.</p>
      
      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #2c3e50; font-size: 16px;">Your Account Features</h3>
        
        {{#if (eq role "student")}}
        <div class="feature-item">Search and browse PG accommodations near your college</div>
        <div class="feature-item">View detailed property listings with comprehensive information</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Save and organize your favorite properties</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Contact property owners directly through the platform</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Read reviews and ratings from other students</div>
        {{else}}
        <div class="feature-item">List your PG properties after completing payment</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Upload property photos and detailed descriptions</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Receive and manage inquiries from prospective tenants</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Track property views and engagement metrics</div>
        <div class="feature-item">Manage multiple property listings efficiently</div>
        {{/if}}
      </div>
      
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="button">Access Your Account</a>
      </div>
      
      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">If you require assistance getting started or have any questions, please visit our help center or contact our support team.</p>
      
      <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The UniRooms Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p><strong>UniRooms</strong> - Student Accommodation Platform</p>
      <p>© {{year}} UniRooms. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Email: support@pgfinder.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
